From 8a65a06b114915d32897c222b26be69e6204d545 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sandesh Bharadwaj <34365552+tensorsofthewall@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 16:42:14 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Make pipeline-parallel transport pluggable

Add a PipelineTransport protocol and a default MlxRingPipelineTransport that wraps the
existing mx.distributed ring (default behavior unchanged). VLLM_METAL_PP_TRANSPORT_CLS
selects another transport class by qualname; VLLM_METAL_DIST_BACKEND (default gloo)
selects the torch.distributed backend of the worker's control groups. An optional
begin_step hook tells the transport the packed row layout of each step.
